<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1.Results were reviewed by Audit Committee, approved &amp; taken on record by Board at its meeting on 30.06.20.2.Group adopted Ind AS from 01.04.17 &amp; this financial results for qtr&amp; yr ended 31.03.20 is prepared in accordance with principles laid down in Ind AS prescribed u/s133 of Co. Act, 2013 read with relevant Rules &amp; in terms of SEBI cir no.CIR/CFD/FAC/62/2016.3.Status of production &amp; related activities of Holding Company (HCo).remains unchanged as reported for previous qtrs.4. Interest treatment for facilities availed from Banks/FI by HCo.remains unchanged as reported for  previous  qtrs.5.HCo. has identified its Chennai Insulator Div (12 m) &amp; Vizag Insulator Div (wef 01.10.19 for 6 m) under Ind AS105 &amp; accordingly adjustments are shown separately in statement of P/L. Hence previous period figures are not comparable.6.HCo. has partially complied with terms of settlement agreements executed with secured lenders (SL) as highlighted in annual report forF.Y ending 31.03.19 but HCo has been unable to complete full &amp;final settlement due in Feb19.  Pursuant to same, HCo.has received latest claim letter in Jan 20 claiming repayment of contractual dues as on 31.12.19 as follows: (i) Rs.427.41 Cr from EARC,(ii) Rs.84.09 cr from ITSL &amp;(iii) Rs.133.67 cr from AFPL, Claim amounts include interest up to said period &amp; other charges as provided for under respective financing documents entered into by HCo.HCo.is in discussions with SL for its resolution.7.As required under Ind AS36 Impairment amounting to Rs.4570 L has been provided in books of Vizag Insulator Div of HCo. (considered as discontinued operations) with reference to Land on unexpired Lease period (as on 31.03.20), Buildings on Card Rate &amp; other fixed assets on respective WDV basis. Provision made in  earlierQtr stands reversed.8. HCo.has subscribed to 50000 Equity Shares of Rs.10/- each fully paid up in its subsidiary, viz., WS Insulators (P) Ltd, incorporated on 14.11.19.9.  Pursuant to approval of Shareholders of HCo. through Postal Ballot Notice dt26.04.19 &amp; result dt 8.06.19, sale of 50100 equity shares of Rs.10/- each for Rs.5.01 L held by HCo. in its erstwhile subsidiary W.S. T&amp;D Ltd was completed.  Earlier provision of Fair Value Loss of Rs.5.01 L stands reversed.10.In terms of Reg 33 of SEBI (LODR) 2015, HCo. has disclosed Consolidated Qtrly Results from qtr ended 30.06.19.11. Consolidated financial statements (CFS) relate toHCo. W.S.Industries (I) Ltd (Parent Company “PE”), &amp; its Subsidiary Companies “Sub Co”.  PE with its Sub Co constitute Group.12. Sub.Co. considered in  CFS  are Vidagara Tech Park (P) Ltd, WS Insulators (P) Ltd&amp; W.S. T &amp; D Ltd (till 09.06.19), whose country of incorporation are in India &amp;  % of voting power by PE as on 31.03.20 is 100%, 100%, nil respectively.13.Group is not required to provide Segment Reporting under  criteria specified in IND AS108.14.Inventories comprising of Raw Materials, WIP, Finished Goods &amp; Stores/Spares to  extent of Rs.41.19 L in Chennai Div,  Rs.73.17 L in  VizagDiv&amp; Capital WIP to extent of Rs.70.37 L in VizagDiv in  HCo.have been fully written off at end of 3rd qtr of current year because of  Discontinued Operations .15.The lockdown &amp; restriction of activities due to Covid-19 does not have any significant impact in HCo.’s overall performance during current period (CP), but has impacted functioning with shutdown of office.  Due to this, efforts of  HCo.on resolution plan is getting delayed. HCo. will be able to get a better clarity only after lockdown is lifted &amp; reasonable normalcy is restored. Regarding Sub Co., effects of COVID-19 pandemic does not have any significant impact on their respective operations &amp; compliances, during CP.16.Figures have been regrouped/reclassified wherever necessary, to conform to this year's classifications.17.figures for qtr ended 31.03.20 are  balancing figures between audited figures in respect of full financial year &amp;  published year to date figures upto 3rdqtr of the F.Y.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
